From: hayward_ling <hayward_ling@realtek.com>
Date: Thu, 18 Jun 2026 13:22:40 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] NASPRJ-1406 add stateful h265 format

---
 media/gpu/v4l2/v4l2_utils.cc       |   6 +-
 media/gpu/v4l2/v4l2_vda_helpers.cc | 126 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 media/gpu/v4l2/v4l2_vda_helpers.h  |  34 ++++++++
